---
project: S3M
rules:
  - Edge and regional tier code must run offline on Jetson-class or single-GPU hardware
  - Core-tier code (the strategist engine, `deployment_profile: government_sovereign`) may require multi-GPU servers. It still has no external API calls
  - Models are quantised per tier
  - No external API calls allowed
  - Every module must include unit tests
  - Use Python 3.11 unless otherwise specified
  - Security-first: validate all inputs
  - Comments must explain military/tactical context
